{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >About The Game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In game your main goal is to collect birch and earning xp to level up your hero.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ways to upgrade your hero</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Skill tree</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Upgrading Items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Gaining level</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Skills to your axe</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Magic spells</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hero base</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hero base is main place to upgrade your stats and gear. Here you can talk with some NPC and restore all of your stats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forest</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Main place where you gather birch and fight some of enemies. Probably here you will spend most of your time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dungeons</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game have few dungeons. Main goal of this dungeons is to get player better items. Every dungeon on the end have a boss fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join discord server to help improving game and talk with our community. Every one can suggest changes or new content to the game! In discord I post more information about the future of the game!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2925040?t=1761599450","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925040/f596b9505b0b8ef4d065f68cbf5dd2cf66b13610/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761599450","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925040/465d373796f23912b6439efcfcb0e8e5aaef2ada/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761599